---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import SiteHeader from "../components/SiteHeader.astro";
import SiteFooter from "../components/SiteFooter.astro";

const lineup = [
  { name: "Adrián Furlan", role: "Songwriter / Guitar" },
  { name: "Jaime Pérez", role: "Bass" },
  { name: "Zahir Chacín", role: "Vocals / Guitar" },
];
---

<Layout title="About · Adrián Furlan">
  <SiteHeader current="about" />
  <main class="page">
    <h1 class="title">About</h1>
    <p class="prose">
      Adrián Furlan is one of the members of the spanish indie rock band known
      only as "The Fearless". Most of the band's initial rehearsals where at his
      home in Valencia, Spain. The band later transitioned to rehearsing in a
      professional recording studio as time went on.
    </p>
    <p class="prose">
      The band formed in September 2024 after connecting with each other via the
      Vampr mobile app. They rehearsed weekly and created an initial setlist of
      seven songs, four of which were recorded in three sessions in October 2025
      to form the basis of this EP.
    </p>
    <p class="prose">
      Despite having several interim drummers, the band has never had a stable
      presence in the drum department. If you are a drummer, enjoy the songs
      posted here and would like to join us, please send me a message via this
      website's contact form and I will try to respond within a couple of days.
    </p>
    <p class="prose">
      The band is currently on hiatus. Our singer, Zahir, moved to Madrid at the
      end of last year, and we haven't found a replacement for him just yet. If
      you are a singer who can sing in English and would like to join the band,
      use the contact form on this website to get in touch with me, and I
      promise I'll get back to you.
    </p>
    <hr class="rule" />
    <section class="band">
      <h2 class="band-name">The Fearless</h2>
      <ul class="lineup">
        {
          lineup.map((member) => (
            <li class="member">
              <span class="member-name">{member.name}</span>
              <span class="member-role">{member.role}</span>
            </li>
          ))
        }
      </ul>
      <p class="credits">
        Drums on the record by Murat Mumcuoglu and [drummer, name to come].
      </p>
      <p class="credits">Produced by VicsMix.</p>
    </section>
  </main>
  <SiteFooter />
</Layout>

<style>
  .page {
    max-width: 880px;
    padding: var(--page-margin) var(--page-margin) 48px;
    margin: 0 auto 40px;
  }

  .title {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: var(--headline-md-size);
    font-weight: var(--weight-bold);
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: var(--headline-md-ls);
    color: var(--sounding-ink);
  }

  .prose {
    max-width: 34em;
    margin: 20px 0 0;
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: var(--body-md-size);
    font-weight: var(--weight-regular);
    line-height: var(--body-lg-lh);
    color: var(--sounding-ink);
    text-align: justify;
    hyphens: auto;
  }

  .title + .prose {
    margin-top: var(--gutter);
  }

  .rule {
    height: var(--rule-weight);
    margin: 40px 0 0;
    border: 0;
    background: var(--light-blue);
  }

  .band {
    margin-top: 20px;
    color: var(--sounding-ink);
  }

  .band-name {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: var(--headline-sm-size);
    font-weight: var(--weight-bold);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .lineup {
    max-width: 520px;
    margin: var(--space-md) auto 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
    border-top: var(--rule-weight) solid var(--light-blue);
  }

  .member {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--gutter);
    padding: 12px 0;
    border-bottom: var(--rule-weight) solid var(--light-blue);
  }

  .member-name {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: var(--body-lg-size);
    font-weight: var(--weight-regular);
    line-height: var(--track-title-lh);
  }

  .member-role {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: var(--label-caps-size);
    font-weight: var(--weight-bold);
    line-height: var(--label-caps-lh);
    letter-spacing: var(--label-caps-ls);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    text-align: right;
    color: var(--chart-grey);
  }

  .credits {
    margin: 1.5em 0 0;
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: var(--weight-regular);
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--chart-grey);
  }

  .lineup + .credits {
    margin-top: 52px;
  }

  @media (width < 720px) {
    .page {
      padding: 28px 20px 0;
    }

    .title {
      font-size: 34px;
      line-height: 1.2;
      letter-spacing: -0.015em;
    }

    .rule {
      margin-top: 28px;
    }

    .band {
      margin-top: 18px;
    }

    .band-name {
      font-size: 24px;
    }

    .lineup {
      max-width: none;
      margin: var(--space-md) 0 0;
    }

    .member-name {
      font-size: var(--body-md-size);
    }

    .credits {
      font-size: var(--body-sm-size);
    }

    .lineup + .credits {
      margin-top: 26px;
    }
  }
</style>
